<title>USA: American Business Products Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Business Products Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMERICAN BUSINESS PRODUCTS, INC.</p>
<p>		Condensed Consolidated Income Statements</p>
<p>	    (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    (Unaudited)</p>
<p> Three months ended			9/30/96	    9/30/95</p>
<p> Net sales				  $ 157,993	 $ 157,169</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold			 109,856	   110,901</p>
<p> Selling and administrative expenses   34,781	    34,309</p>
<p> Restructuring charges			1,498		 ---</p>
<p> Total					  146,135	   145,210</p>
<p> Operating income			    11,858	    11,959</p>
<p>Other income (expense)</p>
<p> Interest expense			   (2,679)	   (2,116)</p>
<p> Miscellaneous - net			  1,471		 269</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		10,650	    10,112</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		 4,271	     4,093</p>
<p> Net income				     6,379	     6,019</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		    .39		 .37</p>
<p>Average number of common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			    16,399,943	16,361,655</p>
<p> Nine months ended			 9/30/96	    9/30/95</p>
<p> Net sales				  $ 472,394	 $ 470,978</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold			 332,032	   331,733</p>
<p> Selling and administrative expenses  104,831	   103,668</p>
<p> Restructuring charges			5,799		 ---</p>
<p> Total					  442,662	   435,401</p>
<p> Operating income			    29,732	    35,577</p>
<p>Other income (expense)</p>
<p> Interest expense			   (6,357)	   (6,474)</p>
<p> Miscellaneous - net			  3,210		 886</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		26,585	    29,989</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		10,412	    12,084</p>
<p> Net income				    16,173	    17,905</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		    .99		1.11</p>
<p>Average number of common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			    16,392,705	16,137,287</p>
<p>Third quarter 1996 results include a restructuring charge of $1,498,000 before income taxes. Third quarter 1996 results also include gains of $1,108,000 before income taxes upon sale of realty rendered redundant by the restructuring, which are included in Miscellaneous Other Income.</p>
<p>The restructuring charge and related realty gains reduced third quarter 1996 net income by $237,000, or $.01 per share.  Without the restructuring charge and related realty gains, the Company would have shown third quarter 1996 net income of $6,616,000 or $.40 per share.</p>
<p>First three quarters 1996 results include a restructuring charge of $5,799,000 and related realty gains of $1,408,000, both before income taxes. These reduced the first three quarters 1996 net income by $2,597,000, or $.15 per share. Without the restructuring charge and related realty gains, the Company would have shown first three quarters 1996 net income of $18,770,034 or $1.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
